``` php
if (mail('user@gmail.com', 'Registration', 'registration test')) {
    echo 'Roger, on the way...';
} else {
    echo 'Nope, errors!';
}
```

in a fresh php file on the same machine you are experiencing the socket exception?

If you get the error message or any warnings the problem is the server configuration, not cakephp or Email class.

